    "title": "ALDOT opens new triple left turn on US-280 W, plans future auxiliary lane - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nathan Prewett ,\n11 hours ago\nBIRMINGHAM, Ala. — The Alabama Department of Transportation (ALDOT) has announced that a new triple left turn from US-280 westbound onto I-459 southbound opened on Wednesday and that an auxiliary lane will be established between the highways and and Acton Road. The announcement stated that the left turn is part of the US-280 widening project […]\nRead full article",
